<title>UK: Commercial Union wins Czech life licence.</title>
<headline>Commercial Union wins Czech life licence.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>British insurance company Commercial Union Plc on Monday confirmed in a statement to the London Stock Exchange that it had won a licence to transact life business in the Czech Republic as part of the continuing expansion of its operations in eastern Europe.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
